WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.230
Today is three short words. In each one, a letter says its own name.

2
00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:11.493
Watch first. The first one on the page is done for you: show it, do the next one together, and your child does the rest.

3
00:00:11.993 --> 00:00:14.572
Watch first. Then do the same with your child.

4
00:00:15.072 --> 00:00:16.743
Say the first word. Go.

5
00:00:18.015 --> 00:00:21.103
The last letter is the heart part. It says its own name.

6
00:00:21.553 --> 00:00:22.535
The word is go.

7
00:00:23.235 --> 00:00:24.687
The second word. No.

8
00:00:26.023 --> 00:00:26.889
As in nest.

9
00:00:27.489 --> 00:00:28.302
It says no.

10
00:00:29.002 --> 00:00:34.931
The third word is a single letter. It says its own name too, and as a word it is always a capital.

11
00:00:35.731 --> 00:00:41.585
Your child may notice that yesterday's words did the same thing. Say yes. That is the idea.

12
00:00:42.035 --> 00:00:45.929
Then step away. For job two, press play on the listening track.

13
00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:50.486
Job three brings back yesterday's four words, and two from day four.
